# Build output
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# The local development database lives at target/grid-dev.db and is therefore already
# covered by /target/ above. It had its own redundant entry (second review, minor 7); the
# location is documented here instead of re-ignored.

# Ignored build/test output (alpha-spec 8.7)
/artifacts/
/mutants.out/

# Raw and derived data — never committed
/data/

# Developer-local notes and overrides (alpha-spec 8.7)
CLAUDE.local.md
.env.local

# Python reference oracle (reference/python/, ADR-012): interpreter caches, virtualenvs and run
# outputs, never committed. Repository-wide on purpose, not only in reference/python/.gitignore:
# check-traceability and check-secrets count UNTRACKED files, so one stray __pycache__/ from a
# pytest run anywhere in the tree fails `just verify` (reproduced in the consolidation inventory:
# 103 of 171 paths untraced). The Flutter/Dart block that stood here went with app/ (ADR-011).
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
/reference/python/data/

# Editor / OS
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# NOTE: Cargo.lock, .sqlx/ and .env ARE committed (alpha-spec 8.7, ADR-002).
